<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="腳註"><span id=".E8.85.B3.E8.A8.BB"></span>腳註</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E5%88%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%A8%B4%E8%A8%9F&amp;action=edit&amp;section=20" title="編輯章節：腳註"><span>編輯</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="註釋"><span id=".E8.A8.BB.E9.87.8B"></span>註釋</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E5%88%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%A8%B4%E8%A8%9F&amp;action=edit&amp;section=21" title="編輯章節：註釋"><span>編輯</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<div id="references-NoteFoot"><ol class="references" data-mw-group="註">
<li id="cite&#95;note-1"><span class="mw-cite-backlink"><b><a href="#cite_ref-1">^</a></b></span> <span class="reference-text"><b>刑事程序法</b>以《刑事訴訟法》為主要規範，另包括一些特殊程序或法庭組織的特別<a href="/wiki/%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%B3%95" title="程序法">程序法</a>。</span>
</li>
<li id="cite&#95;note-4"><span class="mw-cite-backlink"><b><a href="#cite_ref-4">^</a></b></span> <span class="reference-text">通常為<a href="/wiki/%E5%BE%8B%E5%B8%AB" title="律師">律師</a>，但依具體法律規定而有不同；如果不是在律師強制代理制度下，辯護人不一定是律師。</span>
</li>
</ol></div>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="引註資料"><span id=".E5.BC.95.E8.A8.BB.E8.B3.87.E6.96.99"></span>引註資料</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E5%88%91%E4%BA%8B%E8%A8%B4%E8%A8%9F&amp;action=edit&amp;section=22" title="編輯章節：引註資料"><span>編輯</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<div class="reflist" style="list-style-type: decimal;">
